      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=3)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
